OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize suspected stolen
OL,4,Agoods worth #10,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has seized suspected
OL,7,Fstolen goods worth about #10,000 as
OL,8,Fpart of an operation to target retail
OL,9,Fcrime and anti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Police said on Sunday
OL,12,Fofficers visited Wellington Street car
OL,13,Fboot sale in Peterborough, along with
OL,14,Fenforcement officers from Peterborough
OL,15,FCity Council and Peterborough Positive.
OL,17,FA man, 39, and a woman, 36, were
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of handling
OL,19,Fstolen goods and have been bailed.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
