OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize suspected stolen
OL,4,Agoods worth #10,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FPep Cipriano, the chief operating
OL,7,Fofficer at Peterborough Positive which
OL,8,Frepresents 350 businesses and
OL,9,Forganisations, said: "By disrupting
OL,10,Foffenders and recovering suspected
OL,11,Fstolen goods, we are sending a clear
OL,12,Fmessage that retail crime will not be
OL,13,Ftolerated."
